Apache-licensed work. As of F-04 none of the shipped Rust crates or npm
runtime packages ships a NOTICE file. scripts/wb-notices.ts reproduces
every NOTICE file it finds in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and fails if the
package is not named in this section, so a new one is listed here as
